                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Michele joined AbbVie in October&amp;nbsp;2020 as the General Manager for Hematology in Global Marketing and Commercial Operations. Over the past four&amp;nbsp;years, he has covered the whole on-market Oncology portfolio. Michele has 25&amp;nbsp;years of experience, of which more than 20&amp;nbsp;in pharma. Before joining AbbVie, he was at an international Swiss pharmaceutical company, where he held various roles of increasing responsibility, including General Manager and Head of Access in Italy, Global Marketing Lead and Global Head of Hematology Commercial Development based in the US. Prior to starting his career in pharma, Michele worked in Consumer Goods, Automotive and Telecoms Industries across all main European Countries, with a focus on Strategy, Marketing, Sales and Reorganizations.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Michele holds a degree in Electronic Engineering and Mathematics from the Università di Pavia.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
